-- FILM-TITLE: "Diffusion Models — From Noise to Structure"
-- FILM: 0 5 "Pure Noise" "The process begins with **pure Gaussian noise** — completely random voxels with no structure."
-- FILM: 5 10 "Step 1 — Predict Noise" "A neural network **scans the noise** and predicts which parts are noise to subtract."
-- FILM: 10 17 "Denoising — Structure Emerges" "Over many steps, the predicted noise is subtracted. **Order crystallizes from chaos.**"
-- FILM: 17 22 "Fine Details" "The rough shape sharpens. **Details emerge** — branches, leaves, texture."
-- FILM: 22 26 "The Generated Object" "All noise removed. A clean, structured **3D tree** — the output of diffusion."
-- FILM: 26 30 "The Process" "The full diffusion pipeline: from **pure noise to structured output** in many small steps."

V 96 56 56
DUR 30
L 1

-- ============================================================
-- NOISE PARTICLES THAT LERP TO TREE POSITIONS
-- Each point starts random, ends at tree position
-- p = clamp((T-5)/12, 0, 1) controls progress
-- ============================================================

-- TRUNK POINTS (brown)
